   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 264 of the laws of 1981, relating to authorizing the\nsale of certain lands in the towns of Cuba, Allegany county and Ischua,\nCattaraugus county, and the state finance law, in relation to the sale of\ncertain lands in the towns of Cuba, Allegany county and Ischua, Cattaraugus\ncounty, and the disbursement of monies from the Cuba lake management fund",
    "basePrintNo": "S1753",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S1753-2021",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
